:: Rogue Setup
<<set $player_class to "Rogue">>
<<set $strength to 10>>
<<set $agility to 15>>
<<set $intelligence to 13>>
<<set $vitality to 10>>
<<set $max_hp to 45>>
<<set $hp to 45>>
<<set $inventory to ["Dagger", "Lockpick", "Leather Armor", "Traveler's Clothes"]>>
<<set $has_iron_sword to false>>

# The Rogue's Path

You are $player_name, a shadow among shadows. Quick fingers, quicker feet. You've made your living where the law doesn't reach -- and Thornwood seems far from any law.

''Starting Stats:''
- Strength: $strength
- Agility: $agility
- Intelligence: $intelligence
- Vitality: $vitality
- HP: $hp / $max_hp
- Gold: $gold
- Inventory: <<print $inventory.join(", ")>>

You feel ready to face whatever Thornwood has in store.

[[Enter Thornwood|Town Square]]
